      "content": "thanks for that. i checked the test keys and the amount is definitely a positive integer. i also tried a few different test cards from the stripe docs and they all gave the same 402. is there any way to see exactly which part of the request is failing? like, is there a specific field in the json response that tells me if it's a decline vs a mismatch?",
